{"id":"506232","name":"鲫鱼萝卜汤","author":"elmonte","authorId":"266491","desc":"","cover":"images/506232/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"萝卜","amount":"1条(3斤)"},{"name":"鲫鱼","amount":"2条(800)g"}],"sub":[{"name":"盐","amount":"适量"},{"name":"姜","amount":"1小块"},{"name":"葱","amount":"2根"},{"name":"料酒","amount":"1大匙"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"鲫鱼洗净，用1茶匙盐和1大匙料酒里外抹匀，腌15分钟。","img":"images/506232/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"萝卜去皮切粗丝。","img":"images/506232/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"姜切片，葱切葱花。","img":"images/506232/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"萝卜放入适量的水煮开。","img":"images/506232/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"热油锅，把鲫鱼煎至两面金黄，姜片在翻面的时候放入爆一下。","img":"images/506232/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"把煎透的鱼和姜片放入萝卜汤中，慢炖20分钟。","img":"images/506232/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"放盐调味。","img":"images/506232/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"撒上葱花即可。","img":"images/506232/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"奶白鲜美的萝卜汤。","img":"images/506232/step_9.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}